  "title": "Trex Named to TIME’s List of “America’s Best Companies 2026”",
  "summary": "WINCHESTER, Va., July 09, 2026 -- Trex Company [NYSE:TREX], the world’s leading brand of wood-alternative decking, railing and outdoor living products, has been named to TIME’s “America’s Best Companies 2026” list. Presented by TIME and research partner Statista, the annual ranking recognizes companies that excel in financial performance, employee satisfaction and sustainability.",
